WEBVTT

00:01.668 --> 00:04.337
I'm Nina, 12 years old.

00:04.337 --> 00:08.041
I was just an ordinary
junior high school student, but...

00:08.041 --> 00:11.277
Since the day I accidentally swallowed
a ball called the Crystal Pearl,

00:11.277 --> 00:14.280
my life has changed pretty drastically.

00:14.280 --> 00:19.452
And the ball happened to be something
that's used for the sorcery test.

00:19.452 --> 00:22.255
The team of the two examinees,
which happens to possess that ball

00:22.255 --> 00:24.883
when the test ends, will pass the test
and become professional sorcerers!

00:27.027 --> 00:29.329
Does that mean I'm going to be
chased down by the examinees?!

00:29.329 --> 00:32.232
- Don't cry!
- I guess you have no choice
but to prepare yourself, Zero.

00:32.232 --> 00:33.500
Huh?

00:33.500 --> 00:35.235
There is only one way to do this.

00:35.235 --> 00:36.836
You will have to protect her
with everything you've got

00:36.836 --> 00:39.339
until the day that the test ends.

00:39.339 --> 00:40.640
Until the day the medicine is completed

00:40.640 --> 00:44.210
and you're able to remove
the Crystal Pearl from her body...

00:44.210 --> 00:46.312
We will protect her with our own hands!

00:46.312 --> 00:47.680
You mean her?!

00:47.680 --> 00:51.718
Me? These guys are going to protect me?

00:51.718 --> 00:52.852
Just like the princes

00:52.852 --> 00:55.422
who bravely face the enemies
no matter how ferocious they are

00:55.422 --> 00:58.224
and fight them for the people
that they love and their own dreams...

00:58.224 --> 01:01.027
These two are going to protect me!

01:01.027 --> 01:13.706
One love! Two love? Three love! Four love?
One love! Two love? Three love! Come on!

01:13.706 --> 01:19.979
Here's what boys don't know.
Girls are moody.

01:19.979 --> 01:26.219
You're a sweet person
and it will be okay tomorrow.

01:26.219 --> 01:32.525
But I feel different today.
I want to go all out!

01:32.525 --> 01:38.798
Because I can't decide it just yet
I want everything

01:38.798 --> 01:45.071
The kinds of love are just like jewels.

01:45.071 --> 01:51.344
Each of them (Shining boys!)
is sparkling. Yes!

01:51.344 --> 01:57.650
They say there is only one true love

01:57.650 --> 02:03.957
But it's okay, we can decide
that at the very last moment

02:03.957 --> 02:10.196
That moment (Happiness)
I will protect it (Happiness)

02:10.196 --> 02:16.503
Come on, let's go find a popping heart

02:16.503 --> 02:22.775
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!
My love! True love! Your love! Pure love!

02:22.775 --> 02:27.542
My love! True love! Your love!
Pure love! My love! True love!

02:37.157 --> 02:38.491
Who are you?

02:38.491 --> 02:39.826
Riru.

02:39.826 --> 02:43.830
Nina Yamada, I want to help you.

02:43.830 --> 02:46.166
What? You want to help me?

02:46.166 --> 02:47.500
What do you mean?

02:47.500 --> 02:50.503
First of all,
why do you know my name?

02:50.503 --> 02:51.504
Let's see...

02:51.504 --> 02:54.340
Who are you? A new examinee?

02:54.340 --> 02:57.844
I don't care who you are!
We are not letting you take Nina!

02:57.844 --> 03:01.848
Hey, what's up with these kids?
They have no manners!

03:01.848 --> 03:02.849
A sorcerer's helper?

03:02.849 --> 03:05.018
I knew you were a sorcerer!

03:05.018 --> 03:07.187
Look how worked up you are!

03:07.187 --> 03:11.191
Listen carefully! We're here on behalf
of the sorcery test headquarters-

03:11.191 --> 03:12.192
Here.

03:12.192 --> 03:13.526
Th-That's-

03:13.526 --> 03:16.196
The medicine to take out
the Crystal Pearl!

03:16.196 --> 03:17.530
Then-

03:17.530 --> 03:18.865
Good for you.

03:18.865 --> 03:22.402
With this, you'll finally
be free from the dangerous life

03:22.402 --> 03:25.371
where you're being
targeted by the examinees.

03:25.371 --> 03:29.042
Come on, now you can
say goodbye to them.

03:29.042 --> 03:31.044
Say goodbye?

03:31.044 --> 03:33.546
What's the matter?
Hurry up and take it!

03:33.546 --> 03:37.209
We came all the way here to give this
to you, hurry up and take that medicine!

03:38.551 --> 03:40.220
What should I do?

03:40.220 --> 03:43.890
If I take this, I'll be free
from my current life,

03:43.890 --> 03:49.062
but that means I have to say goodbye
to Zero and Ichii even before Christmas...

03:49.062 --> 03:54.898
If I take this,
I won't see these two again.

03:56.236 --> 03:59.228
"Goodbye, My Wonderful Princes."

04:01.407 --> 04:04.744
So what are you waiting for?
Are you going to take it or not?

04:04.744 --> 04:06.913
You say that, but I don't know
right this minute

04:06.913 --> 04:11.084
whether it's good for me
to take it or not!

04:11.084 --> 04:13.253
If that's the case,
I will take it!

04:13.253 --> 04:14.254
What?

04:14.254 --> 04:15.255
Forte!

04:15.255 --> 04:18.588
If you say so, give me
that medicine over here!

04:20.593 --> 04:23.263
Zero, Ichii! If you want this back,

04:23.263 --> 04:25.765
I'll exchange it with
the Crystal Pearl itself!

04:25.765 --> 04:26.599
San!

04:26.599 --> 04:29.602
Aye-aye, sir! It's my cue!

04:29.602 --> 04:31.271
Summoning magic!

04:31.271 --> 04:34.604
I shall make a special
summoning of Step Cat!

04:37.610 --> 04:40.280
What does she think she can
do with a single cat anyway?

04:40.280 --> 04:42.043
Massive multiplication!

04:47.954 --> 04:50.790
San, there's no need to stay here long!
Let's get out of here!

04:50.790 --> 04:54.294
Roger! Aye-aye, sir!
See ya, Nina-chan!

04:54.294 --> 04:58.287
Remember we'll exchange the medicine
with the Crystal Pearl!

04:59.299 --> 05:02.302
But is that medicine really necessary?

05:02.302 --> 05:05.305
Because I don't even know if
it's better for the Crystal Pearl

05:05.305 --> 05:08.808
to remain in my body
like it's been or not.

05:08.808 --> 05:10.310
Ichii-sama!

05:10.310 --> 05:11.844
Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama!

05:11.844 --> 05:14.813
You evil-spirited cats!!
Get away from Ichii-sama!

05:17.650 --> 05:18.985
Rokka?

05:18.985 --> 05:23.323
Ichii-sama, let me handle this,
because if she takes that

05:23.323 --> 05:27.660
you'll no longer have to protect
Nina, right, Ichii-sama?

05:27.660 --> 05:28.661
What?

05:28.661 --> 05:32.565
If so, this is a perfect opportunity
to separate these two!

05:32.565 --> 05:34.334
I'll retrieve that no matter what!

05:34.334 --> 05:36.336
Let's go!

05:36.336 --> 05:38.671
Certainly, Lady Rokka.

05:38.671 --> 05:40.006
You are-

05:40.006 --> 05:41.337
I'm Gou.

05:46.679 --> 05:49.682
Hey! Give me that medicine over here!

05:49.682 --> 05:51.017
No, I will not!

05:51.017 --> 05:54.520
Give it to me! Hey, wait!

05:54.520 --> 05:55.355
No way!

05:55.355 --> 05:56.356
We won't wait!

05:56.356 --> 05:57.523
Stop screwing around!

05:57.523 --> 06:00.360
Lady Rokka, please do not
use vulgar language.

06:00.360 --> 06:01.361
You bastard!

06:01.361 --> 06:02.528
I will not wait!

06:02.528 --> 06:04.030
Hey, hey, hey!

06:04.030 --> 06:05.365
Lady Rokka...

06:05.365 --> 06:07.700
Eh, things are looking pretty crazy...

06:07.700 --> 06:10.370
I can't believe they're doing
whatever they want!

06:10.370 --> 06:15.041
Hey, Forte!
We don't need that medicine!

06:15.041 --> 06:16.201
What?

06:18.711 --> 06:22.715
Aww, Ichii-sama! What do you mean
you don't need that medicine?

06:22.715 --> 06:24.550
Yeah, why?

06:24.550 --> 06:25.718
That's right! That's right!

06:25.718 --> 06:27.720
We went through all the trouble
giving it to you,

06:27.720 --> 06:29.555
so what do you mean
"You don't need it"?

06:29.555 --> 06:34.394
Because we've decided that we're going
to protect Nina till the end.

06:34.394 --> 06:38.064
Basically it's too late for us to need
the medicine to remove the Crystal Pearl!

06:38.064 --> 06:39.732
- Isn't that right, Nina-chan?
- Isn't that right, Nina?

06:39.732 --> 06:44.404
What? So that means I'll still
get to stay close to you guys!

06:44.404 --> 06:47.073
No way...

06:47.073 --> 06:48.074
Then I'll take it!

06:48.074 --> 06:51.411
Hey, you guys,
stop saying carefree things!

06:51.411 --> 06:54.080
You don't have much time left
before the sorcery test is over!

06:54.080 --> 06:56.082
There definitely will be more
fights over the Crystal Pearl

06:56.082 --> 06:59.419
among the examinees and
they'll only get fiercer!

06:59.419 --> 07:01.754
Do you have any idea
how dangerous it is

07:01.754 --> 07:05.925
for a non-magic-user to be
involved in such a situation?

07:05.925 --> 07:07.627
- No, I don't!
- Zura!

07:07.627 --> 07:09.429
You're one nagging crow, you know that?

07:09.429 --> 07:11.597
But what she's saying does make sense.

07:11.597 --> 07:13.433
Ichii, what are you talking about?

07:13.433 --> 07:18.438
It'll be fine as long as we protect
her till the end! Let's go, Nina!

07:18.438 --> 07:19.772
Hey, you wait right there!

07:19.772 --> 07:24.110
Keep me out of it, okay!
I bet it's going to be a disaster!

07:24.110 --> 07:26.112
We'll keep that in mind!

07:26.112 --> 07:27.613
Thanks.

07:27.613 --> 07:30.450
What's your problem?
I'm going to make you pay for this!

07:30.450 --> 07:32.618
But...

07:32.618 --> 07:35.121
That girl will take the medicine.

07:35.121 --> 07:36.456
Huh?

07:36.456 --> 07:40.126
That's what her future indicates.

07:40.126 --> 07:42.788
I'm certain she will...

07:46.466 --> 07:48.134
So what are you going
to do about the gift?

07:48.134 --> 07:49.469
Have you bought the cake yet?

07:49.469 --> 07:52.805
Hey, Nina, do you want to go
shopping after school today?

07:52.805 --> 07:55.141
I've found this cute
cellular phone strap!

07:55.141 --> 07:58.478
Oh, today I'm...

07:58.478 --> 08:02.815
Oh, that's right! Today is
December 24th, Christmas Eve!

08:02.815 --> 08:05.651
I guess you don't have time
to be hanging out with us, huh?

08:05.651 --> 08:06.486
What?

08:06.486 --> 08:09.155
Hey, Nina, which one
of Zero-kun and Ichii-kun

08:09.155 --> 08:11.991
have you decided to spend
Christmas Eve with?

08:11.991 --> 08:14.327
No, that's not what I was going to-

08:14.327 --> 08:15.828
Come on, don't be shy!

08:15.828 --> 08:18.164
Oh well, I guess there's nothing we can
do about it if you already have a plan.

08:18.164 --> 08:19.832
Okay, maybe next time then!

08:19.832 --> 08:22.502
Eh, what, what?

08:22.502 --> 08:25.505
It's not like that, Hatsuka, Yo-chan...

08:25.505 --> 08:28.841
Today is the last day that
I could spend time with them...

08:28.841 --> 08:31.511
The last day of the sorcery test...

08:31.511 --> 08:34.844
Today is the last day that
I could be with Zero and Ichii...

08:37.016 --> 08:41.510
I won't be seeing this face tomorrow.

08:42.522 --> 08:44.857
Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama! Ichii-sama!

08:44.857 --> 08:49.529
I've missed you, Ichii-sama!
It's been a few days, hasn't it?

08:49.529 --> 08:50.530
Rokka!

08:50.530 --> 08:52.532
What are you doing,
wearing a uniform?

08:52.532 --> 08:56.702
Grrr! What's your problem, Nina?
I've brought some good stuff for you!

08:56.702 --> 08:59.205
G-Good stuff?

08:59.205 --> 09:00.206
Ta-da!

09:00.206 --> 09:01.874
This is the good stuff?

09:01.874 --> 09:05.211
This is the medicine that
Riru brought the other day.

09:05.211 --> 09:06.879
But we don't need it.

09:06.879 --> 09:08.881
Of course you do need it!

09:08.881 --> 09:12.218
If you take it you can take
the pearl out! So come on!

09:12.218 --> 09:14.720
Stop your grumbling
and hurry up and take it!

09:14.720 --> 09:17.223
I don't want to!
Hey, stop it, Rokka!

09:17.223 --> 09:19.892
Take it now and say
goodbye to Ichii-sama!

09:19.892 --> 09:21.561
No way! Stop it, Rokka!

09:21.561 --> 09:22.562
Stop it!

09:22.562 --> 09:26.732
Oh, no! Give it back,
Ichii-sama! She needs it!

09:26.732 --> 09:29.569
Come on, Lady Rokka.
It's time for a nap.

09:29.569 --> 09:31.737
No, I'm not sleepy yet!

09:31.737 --> 09:34.407
I'm not going to sleep until
she takes the medicine!

09:34.407 --> 09:37.243
Because I know it's better
to take the pearl out of her!

09:37.243 --> 09:39.912
It's much easier
to protect her that way.

09:39.912 --> 09:43.916
But Nina absolutely refuses
to take the medicine!

09:43.916 --> 09:47.920
She has no idea she's been
such a burden to Ichii-sama!

09:47.920 --> 09:51.257
Things could be much easier for Ichii-sama
if only she took the medicine!

09:51.257 --> 09:54.093
She just doesn't understand
that she's being such a burden!

09:54.093 --> 09:57.263
Am I being a burden?

09:57.263 --> 09:58.764
No, not at all.

09:58.764 --> 10:01.267
Don't worry about it, Nina-chan.

10:01.267 --> 10:03.936
I don't think you're a burden at all.

10:03.936 --> 10:08.274
More importantly, I want
to be with you, Nina-chan...

10:08.274 --> 10:10.265
I want to be with you, Nina-chan...

10:12.945 --> 10:14.614
Ichii...

10:14.614 --> 10:19.285
I'll keep this medicine for now,
but you wouldn't need it anyway, right?

10:19.285 --> 10:22.455
Because I'm always going
to be with you, Nina-chan.

10:22.455 --> 10:24.957
How about you? Would it bother you
if I were always around you?

10:24.957 --> 10:30.796
What? B-B-B-B-Bother me? No!

10:30.796 --> 10:31.631
Nina-chan?

10:31.631 --> 10:33.292
R-R-R-Restroom!

10:36.636 --> 10:40.306
Boy... Ichii said...

10:40.306 --> 10:42.308
I want to be with you...

10:42.308 --> 10:46.145
How about you? Would it bother you
if I were always around you?

10:46.145 --> 10:47.647
Oh my!

10:47.647 --> 10:51.150
I didn't know what he was
going to tell me! Geez!

10:51.150 --> 10:54.320
Judging from how you're acting,
you must have not drank it yet.

10:54.320 --> 10:55.321
The crow...

10:55.321 --> 10:57.657
How insulting! My name is Ruby!

10:57.657 --> 10:58.824
And...

10:58.824 --> 11:01.315
Have you forgotten? I'm Riru.

11:03.329 --> 11:04.330
Are you okay?

11:04.330 --> 11:07.166
Ouch. I failed to land properly again.

11:07.166 --> 11:08.334
Um...

11:08.334 --> 11:12.004
Hurry up and take the medicine!
I told you it's dangerous, didn't I?

11:12.004 --> 11:14.666
But I'll be fine!
Even just now Ichii told me-

11:16.676 --> 11:20.346
Something is coming.
Something very cold...

11:20.346 --> 11:21.681
- What?
- What?

11:21.681 --> 11:23.012
It's coming!

11:28.354 --> 11:29.689
What's that?

11:29.689 --> 11:31.023
Ice crystals.

11:31.023 --> 11:32.692
Was that magic?

11:32.692 --> 11:35.528
That's right! That was
the attack by new examinees!

11:35.528 --> 11:37.697
There're more powerful
than Forte and San!

11:37.697 --> 11:42.868
Riru, what makes you think it's okay for
an outsider to block examinees' attacks?

11:42.868 --> 11:45.705
But Nina would end up
getting hurt badly if I don't.

11:45.705 --> 11:48.374
Exactly! Getting hurt badly!
See, you know what I mean?

11:48.374 --> 11:51.043
They're after you! It's dangerous!

11:51.043 --> 11:53.045
Th-that's true...

11:53.045 --> 11:57.383
I have been attacked by San-chan,
Fo-chan, Rokka and Gou before,

11:57.383 --> 12:01.387
but the attack those new examinees
released on me just now

12:01.387 --> 12:03.048
was completely different.

12:04.223 --> 12:07.727
They're more dangerous
and more frightening...

12:07.727 --> 12:11.063
But, how did you know those
ice crystals were flying towards us?

12:11.063 --> 12:12.064
That's because-

12:12.064 --> 12:16.736
Riru can see the future. He said
you would take the medicine.

12:16.736 --> 12:18.738
No way! You can see the future?

12:18.738 --> 12:21.407
Riru, why don't you show her
a little bit about it?

12:21.407 --> 12:23.743
You know, her future.

12:23.743 --> 12:25.411
Sure, I can do that.

12:25.411 --> 12:28.247
I'll show you your future...

12:28.247 --> 12:30.738
What's going to happen
to you in the future...

12:33.085 --> 12:35.747
Future projection magic! Illusion!

12:43.763 --> 12:47.426
I-I'm taking the medicine!

12:50.436 --> 12:53.606
See, I told you.
That's your future.

12:53.606 --> 12:55.775
That's what's going
to happen to you.

12:55.775 --> 12:56.776
Riru!

12:56.776 --> 13:00.780
Was that the real future? Is the
same thing really going to happen?

13:00.780 --> 13:05.785
That's right. You will take the medicine
because that's the answer you'll reach.

13:05.785 --> 13:07.787
What? What do you mean by that?

13:07.787 --> 13:09.221
Why would I do that?

13:09.221 --> 13:13.626
And there's one more thing.
All of them will fail this sorcery test.

13:13.626 --> 13:15.361
- What?
- What?

13:15.361 --> 13:21.630
And after that you'll never
see Zero and Ichii again.

13:27.306 --> 13:28.474
No way...

13:28.474 --> 13:31.310
Zero and Ichii will fail
the sorcery test,

13:31.310 --> 13:35.648
then after that I'll
never see them...

13:35.648 --> 13:37.479
...again?

13:50.162 --> 13:52.498
Hmm, what's that supposed to mean?

13:52.498 --> 13:55.167
Why would I want to take the medicine?

13:55.167 --> 13:56.836
That's just impossible!

13:56.836 --> 13:59.031
But in the future, I was...

14:01.006 --> 14:03.175
taking the medicine...

14:03.175 --> 14:05.177
Hey, Nina!

14:05.177 --> 14:07.012
Where have you been?

14:07.012 --> 14:09.515
We told you not to stray
away from us, didn't we?

14:09.515 --> 14:12.848
You know, the attacks by the examinees
will only get worse now.

14:16.355 --> 14:17.686
Nina-chan!!

14:27.199 --> 14:28.530
Defense magic!

14:31.871 --> 14:33.539
I won't let you!

14:33.539 --> 14:35.200
Fireball!

14:36.876 --> 14:38.878
Nina-chan, are you okay?

14:38.878 --> 14:40.212
Y-Yeah...

14:40.212 --> 14:44.884
Damn it! That was the attack
by some new examinees!

14:44.884 --> 14:47.553
The lollipop that
I got from Ichii is-

14:47.553 --> 14:50.890
How did they manage to break
Ichii's defense magic?

14:50.890 --> 14:53.893
It seems that the attacks
have gotten much more extreme

14:53.893 --> 14:56.395
the closer it gets to the test.

14:56.395 --> 14:59.899
But I bet you they're
pretty freaked out,

14:59.899 --> 15:01.734
because all we've seen
is nothing but their attacks!

15:01.734 --> 15:04.236
They haven't shown their faces
in front of us at all!

15:04.236 --> 15:05.237
Give me a break!

15:05.237 --> 15:06.898
Who would be freaked out?

15:07.907 --> 15:10.239
Sounds like we get
no respect around here!

15:11.911 --> 15:12.900
Look out!

15:13.913 --> 15:17.917
Examinees #011 and #012,
Eleven and-

15:17.917 --> 15:19.585
Twel-

15:19.585 --> 15:20.586
Tomi and-

15:20.586 --> 15:21.587
lyo!

15:21.587 --> 15:25.591
Um, I'm the examinee #012, Twel-

15:25.591 --> 15:27.426
And here we are!

15:27.426 --> 15:29.929
Examinees #015 and #016!

15:29.929 --> 15:32.932
Fifteen and Sixteen!

15:32.932 --> 15:35.935
Hey, is your outfit supposed
to be the Santa Claus's outfit?

15:35.935 --> 15:37.269
Shut up!

15:37.269 --> 15:39.605
- Aren't you cold?
- Aren't you cold?

15:39.605 --> 15:41.440
I know this is going
to be in this year!

15:41.440 --> 15:43.943
This is definitely going
to be a huge hit this year!

15:43.943 --> 15:46.278
But more importantly, Zero, Ichii!

15:46.278 --> 15:48.614
The Crystal Pearl is ours!

15:48.614 --> 15:49.949
Flame magic!

15:49.949 --> 15:51.450
Ice magic!

15:51.450 --> 15:52.952
Hottest Blizzard!

15:52.952 --> 15:54.286
Ice Metal Mist!

15:54.286 --> 15:55.617
- Launch!
- Launch!

15:58.624 --> 16:00.292
Ichii!

16:00.292 --> 16:03.796
Being attacked by four people
at the same time is no joke!

16:03.796 --> 16:06.629
Don't think this is my real power!

16:10.636 --> 16:13.639
Hey, Ichii! Protect Nina quick!

16:13.639 --> 16:14.640
Shoot!

16:14.640 --> 16:16.130
Charm Capsule!

16:18.644 --> 16:21.981
It's no use zura!
There's no way an ordinary human

16:21.981 --> 16:25.985
could take this in the center
of the magic activation zura.

16:25.985 --> 16:27.319
We're going to withdraw for now!

16:27.319 --> 16:28.487
But Ichii-

16:28.487 --> 16:31.490
Let's get out of here!
Nina's safety is more important!

16:31.490 --> 16:32.821
All right!

16:43.335 --> 16:44.336
So they escaped.

16:44.336 --> 16:47.169
But next time we'll do it.

16:50.175 --> 16:53.512
Hey, Ichii, are you being serious?

16:53.512 --> 16:56.348
Shut up, and calm down!

16:56.348 --> 16:58.684
Because you said you're going
to make Nina drink the medicine!

16:58.684 --> 17:01.687
I just thought that might
be better for her.

17:01.687 --> 17:02.688
Don't give me that crap!

17:02.688 --> 17:06.525
But you did see that, too, right, Zero?
Their attack from earlier...

17:06.525 --> 17:10.529
What if six people, or even eight people
did that together next time?

17:10.529 --> 17:14.566
Do you think our power alone
can block that then?

17:14.566 --> 17:17.703
No, even if we managed to block it,

17:17.703 --> 17:21.696
do you think she would
be able to withstand that?

17:23.042 --> 17:24.877
Just like Ruby said,

17:24.877 --> 17:29.048
it may be best to remove
the Crystal Pearl from Nina-chan

17:29.048 --> 17:31.884
in order to really protect her.

17:31.884 --> 17:34.053
The more intense the attacks get,

17:34.053 --> 17:37.056
the greater the risk becomes
for Nina-chan to get severely injured!

17:37.056 --> 17:38.223
You understand that, right, Zero?

17:38.223 --> 17:39.725
No, I don't!

17:39.725 --> 17:42.795
We promised that we would
protect Nina, didn't we?

17:42.795 --> 17:46.065
We promised that we would protect
her with everything we've got

17:46.065 --> 17:49.068
until the last day of the sorcery test
no matter what happens, didn't we?

17:49.068 --> 17:50.669
Protect Nina right there!

17:50.669 --> 17:55.074
Zero, you must think there will be
nothing left to connect Nina-chan and us

17:55.074 --> 17:59.244
once the Crystal Pearl
gets removed from her, right?

17:59.244 --> 18:00.746
Ichii, you-

18:00.746 --> 18:02.748
Don't you want to be with Nina?

18:02.748 --> 18:06.752
Of course I do! But, Zero,
we can't afford to put her in danger

18:06.752 --> 18:10.789
just for that reason! Don't you agree?

18:10.789 --> 18:11.924
But still-

18:11.924 --> 18:16.258
What would you do if something
happened to Nina-chan, Zero?

18:19.598 --> 18:23.602
Would you still want
to put Nina-chan in danger?

18:23.602 --> 18:25.771
Ichii...

18:25.771 --> 18:27.106
Damn it!

18:27.106 --> 18:29.608
Just be patient.

18:29.608 --> 18:31.769
To protect Nina-chan.

18:37.116 --> 18:38.951
No...

18:38.951 --> 18:44.456
I don't want to be separated from you...
Even if I'm in danger!

18:44.456 --> 18:46.859
I don't want to be separated
from you, Zero, Ichii!

18:46.859 --> 18:49.795
Please, Zero, Ichii, stay by my side!

18:49.795 --> 18:53.232
Just until the sorcery test is over!

18:53.232 --> 18:54.466
Nina-chan...

18:54.466 --> 18:56.135
Nina!

18:56.135 --> 18:59.138
I want you to be with me
for a long time!

18:59.138 --> 19:01.473
My Zero and Ichii!

19:01.473 --> 19:04.143
Nina! Nina!!

19:04.143 --> 19:06.145
Zero! Zero!!

19:06.145 --> 19:10.149
Yeah, no matter who they are
we will protect you, Nina!

19:10.149 --> 19:11.884
We'll protect you no matter what!

19:11.884 --> 19:13.152
All right, I get it!

19:13.152 --> 19:15.487
If that's what Nina-chan wants,
there's nothing we can do about it.

19:15.487 --> 19:19.825
We will protect Nina-chan until 12 AM
on the last day of the sorcery test

19:19.825 --> 19:22.661
even if we have to use all
our remaining strength! Got it?

19:22.661 --> 19:23.495
Yeah!

19:23.495 --> 19:25.986
Ichii! Zero!

19:32.004 --> 19:33.665
We found you!

19:35.507 --> 19:36.940
Where do you think you're going?

19:40.179 --> 19:41.168
Crap!

19:49.688 --> 19:51.019
Defense magic!

19:52.691 --> 19:54.682
Hurry up and take Nina-chan!

19:58.530 --> 20:00.199
Damn it!

20:00.199 --> 20:02.190
Fireball Piston!

20:05.204 --> 20:06.205
Shit!

20:06.205 --> 20:08.874
Wait, wait, wait!

20:08.874 --> 20:10.865
I am the one you need to fight!

20:13.212 --> 20:14.713
- Who are you?
- Who are you?

20:14.713 --> 20:16.882
Nanase! Yakumo-kun!

20:16.882 --> 20:20.886
Nina! Come on, don't sound like a
stranger calling me with the "-kun" stuff!

20:20.886 --> 20:23.722
You see, I've finished my training
and come back for you!

20:23.722 --> 20:25.724
So just call me "Yakumo"!

20:25.724 --> 20:28.560
Hey, do you have any idea
what's happening right now?

20:28.560 --> 20:30.221
That's right! You're in our way!

20:31.897 --> 20:32.898
But you know what?

20:32.898 --> 20:36.561
Stuff like that can be turned into
"clink-clink" with my weaponry magic!

20:39.905 --> 20:42.237
How do you like me now?
Tell me you're impressed-

20:44.576 --> 20:48.914
What the? Pitch black all of a sudden?
Was that the darkness magic?

20:48.914 --> 20:51.250
I don't think that was it.

20:51.250 --> 20:52.581
You're not getting away!

20:56.255 --> 20:57.586
Take this!

21:00.926 --> 21:02.587
Nina! Nina!!

21:11.270 --> 21:12.604
Zero!

21:12.604 --> 21:14.273
Zero!!

21:14.273 --> 21:16.942
It's okay! More importantly,
are you all right, Nina?

21:16.942 --> 21:20.279
No, Zero! You need to worry
about yourself, not me!

21:20.279 --> 21:21.947
Defense magic!

21:21.947 --> 21:23.282
Ichii!

21:23.282 --> 21:25.617
Nina-chan... Are you okay?

21:25.617 --> 21:27.953
What, "am I okay"?

21:27.953 --> 21:32.124
Both Zero and Ichii have sustained
injuries that are much worse than mine,

21:32.124 --> 21:34.456
but they still tried to protect me...

21:35.460 --> 21:36.628
Here comes the finishing touch!

21:36.628 --> 21:38.964
I'll end this for you with this!

21:38.964 --> 21:40.966
Stop doing this already!

21:40.966 --> 21:42.297
Stop it!!

21:43.302 --> 21:44.803
Zero! Ichii!

21:44.803 --> 21:46.293
Noooo!!!

21:50.309 --> 21:51.310
Guys...

21:51.310 --> 21:54.479
I will not forgive anyone
who hurts Ichii-sama!

21:54.479 --> 21:55.981
Hiya!

21:55.981 --> 21:58.583
You overdid it!

21:58.583 --> 21:59.985
Don't be naive!

21:59.985 --> 22:02.654
You must be aware of the risk
involved in the sorcery test!

22:02.654 --> 22:03.643
Risk?

22:06.992 --> 22:08.160
That's right...

22:08.160 --> 22:09.828
I must've been taking it for granted.

22:09.828 --> 22:11.997
I must've been taking
their kindness for granted,

22:11.997 --> 22:15.000
and as a result I've made
them get hurt so badly...

22:15.000 --> 22:17.002
I don't want to be
separated from them...

22:17.002 --> 22:22.338
But I can't stand to watch them
being in danger for me any more!

22:24.343 --> 22:25.510
Hey, Nina!

22:25.510 --> 22:26.678
Nina-chan?

22:26.678 --> 22:29.181
Goodbye, Zero... Ichii...

22:29.181 --> 22:32.351
I hope you two become
wonderful sorcerers!

22:32.351 --> 22:33.352
Hey, Nina!

22:33.352 --> 22:34.686
Nina!

22:34.686 --> 22:36.347
- Nina-chan!
- Zura!

22:37.856 --> 22:40.859
Goodbye... We had a good time, didn't we?

22:40.859 --> 22:43.362
I wish we could've had a chance

22:43.362 --> 22:45.697
to go to the hot spring
and the swimming pool together again...

22:45.697 --> 22:48.200
Zero... Ichii...

22:48.200 --> 22:52.704
Thank you for so many fun memories.

22:52.704 --> 22:55.707
I love you both so much.

22:55.707 --> 22:57.042
Nina!

22:57.042 --> 22:58.377
Nina!!

22:58.377 --> 23:02.040
Pass the test, okay...
My princes...

23:08.887 --> 23:12.880
After all we couldn't change the future
that Riru foresaw, could we?

23:14.393 --> 23:15.394
Ya!

23:15.394 --> 23:16.725
Hey, it got away!

23:18.063 --> 23:19.394
What the?

23:25.904 --> 23:29.408
What's happening to the Crystal Pearl?

23:29.408 --> 23:31.743
The test is going to be over soon.

23:31.743 --> 23:33.578
And so is Christmas...

23:33.578 --> 23:37.241
And that is when
our separation begins...

23:44.423 --> 23:47.259
Pit-a-pat, skip! Parallel pop!

23:47.259 --> 23:50.228
Pit-a-pat, step! Miracle kiss!

23:50.228 --> 23:53.254
Pit-a-pat, magical! Lollipop!

24:02.040 --> 24:07.846
My heart is beating so fast.
He might notice.

24:07.846 --> 24:13.652
My heart is pounding and throbbing.
It feels like it's going to burst.

24:13.652 --> 24:19.524
No matter which direction
I look, his eyes are crystals.

24:19.524 --> 24:25.430
They are so brilliant
that I just look away.

24:25.430 --> 24:31.269
The seed of love has begun to sprout.
Even my magic, too! Check it out!

24:31.269 --> 24:39.744
They will keep on growing
and spinning and explode!

24:39.744 --> 24:45.417
Popping lollipop. Save me, lollipop!
Throbbing heart.

24:45.417 --> 24:51.723
Two candies, I can't decide
which one is better.

24:51.723 --> 24:57.629
Even the earth turns the other way,
if you hold me,

24:57.629 --> 25:03.468
the shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat!

25:03.468 --> 25:09.065
The shape of my heart will change
just like pit-a-pat! Lollipop!

25:11.510 --> 25:14.846
Everyone, the sorcery test
has almost come to a climax!

25:14.846 --> 25:18.517
It's no use, Will.
No one will pass the test.

25:18.517 --> 25:20.519
That's what the future indicates.

25:20.519 --> 25:23.688
Damn it! I will never give up!

25:23.688 --> 25:26.191
We will become pros no matter what!

25:26.191 --> 25:28.193
Next time on Save Me! Lollipop!

25:28.193 --> 25:29.194
Final episode!

25:29.194 --> 25:31.463
Come Back and Save Me, Lollipop!

25:31.463 --> 25:34.533
I have faith in you, Zero, Ichii!

25:34.533 --> 25:36.524
I know you will pass the test!
